      "source": "CPIC",
      "summaryMarkdown": {
        "id": 1449753103,
        "html": "<p>The CPIC dosing guideline recommends that a lower than standard starting dose of azathioprine should be considered for TPMT or NUDT15 intermediate metabolizers. Compound TMPT/NUDT15 intermediate metabolizers require further dose reduction compared to single gene intermediate metabolizers. For TPMT and/or NUDT15 poor metabolizers, an alternative immunosuppressant therapy should be considered.</p>\n"
      }
